 0.17889088591033428, "text": "The lessons are in a very old school, but we", "w": 0.304114481608073, "y": 0.252833935202288, "h": 0.012718390075738675}, {"h": 0.008851743820341854, "x": 0.17889087706527998, "text": "are A", "y": 0.2668168605373218, "w": 0.03756708357069227}, {"x": 0.3076923109082477, "w": 0.16457960340711802, "text": "a new school! We work", "y": 0.26808139568426476, "h": 0.010271492581074886}, {"x": 0.17710196751141655, "h": 0.013928144709728182, "y": 0.2807084834234199, "w": 0.28443649291992185, "text": "on the building in the afternoons and on"}, {"y": 0.29459740723049094, "x": 0.17698886284213844, "h": 0.01548052512351357, "w": 0.29894972059461805, "text": "Saturdays. It's hard work but I enjoy it. And"}, {"x": 0.17531305776803643, "y": 0.30976083068107596, "text": "this place is so beautiful! [....]", "w": 0.20393559773763023, "h": 0.012695564431834358}, {"y": 0.33130813977087037, "x": 0.2933810387082613, "h": 0.006322674157387121, "w": 0.023255812327067082, "text": "***"}, {"text": "Terry:", "w": 0.042933807373046876, "x": 0.10912343571419213, "y": 0.34395348847524376, "h": 0.012645348314774147}, {"text": "Hi. I'm B", "x": 0.17710196824167387, "h": 0.011417334363778899, "y": 0.3439169676634799, "w": 0.06082289801703558}, {"y": 0.34484637654842676, "x": 0.3272891531869791, "text": "on a gardening", "h": 0.01338864269669738, "w": 0.11286355760362415}, {"y": 0.35912790744871753, "w": 0.30411448160807286, "text": "project. We run a vegetable garden next to", "x": 0.17710197398427593, "h": 0.012663609129427173}, {"text": "the local hospital so we can grow / eat fresh", "y": 0.37296931396395216, "w": 0.3166368272569444, "h": 0.012713825246487192, "x": 0.1753130751237638}, {"y": 0.3869476744474479, "h": 0.013909883895075253, "text": "vegetables for the patients. I like *making /", "w": 0.30590338812934026, "x": 0.17531306677313535}, {"text": "working with my hands and it's great to work", "x": 0.17531305931410796, "y": 0.4008438627684645, "h": 0.013923579131653152, "w": 0.31842576768663194}, {"y": 0.41458483783474165, "text": "outside. Some of the patients also help / sleep", "h": 0.015357022380140249, "w": 0.3202146742078993, "x": 0.17531305378752324}, {"text": "in the garden [...]", "x": 0.171735242909292, "w": 0.13237924363878037, "y": 0.4298962094806762, "h": 0.012690999602582971}, {"x": 0.2915921284030036, "y": 0.45143895357178365, "w": 0.021466905805799685, "h": 0.005058139325909658, "text": "***"}, {"w": 0.31842576768663194, "text": "Richard: Hello everyone. | work / teach with", "x": 0.10733452195274841, "y": 0.4640523463263769, "h": 0.014133574007220224}, {"x": 0.17531305851804355, "h": 0.01266817395867856, "text": "homeless children, mainly teenagers. I talk to", "y": 0.4792587211408688, "w": 0.3184257676866319}, {"text": "them in the street and try to help them. We", "x": 0.1717352499603746, "h": 0.014133574007220224, "w": 0.3059033881293403, "y": 0.4931046931472255}, {"w": 0.3220035807291667, "text": "also run a bakery together. The young people", "x": 0.17173524326690134, "h": 0.013909883895075253, "y": 0.5070784882470846}, {"w": 0.3062423027886284, "x": 0.17155402857183302, "y": 0.5196432055928395, "text": "do / make the bread; they learn to work in", "h": 0.015367892304912818}, {"text": "a team and they learn practical skills. They", "w": 0.2969588555230035, "h": 0.015352457550888862, "x": 0.17173524064636947, "y": 0.5347202164025106}, {"w": 0.2915921359592014, "h": 0.013909883895075253, "text": "do / make some money and they always", "x": 0.1717352343236194, "y": 0.5488081392739377}, {"w": 0.2939069620768229, "x": 0.1714304197135967, "text": "have something to eat. The kids are great", "y": 0.5626323166896773, "h": 0.01630930521858305}, {"text": "and they're C_", "y": 0.5773847725534591, "w": 0.10399496290418836, "h": 0.01366068660137025, "x": 0.1698272067869458}, {"w": 0.10554561191134987, "h": 0.010207581227436872, "text": "me real street", "x": 0.3506261224581592, "y": 0.5790839351500444}, {